    "What minimum copper grounding electrode conductor connects this service only to the stated electrode, without continuing to another electrode? For a ground ring, assume a 2 AWG copper ring. Assume physical protection where required by 250.64(B)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welchen Mindestquerschnitt hat der Erdungselektrodenleiter aus Kupfer, der diesen Service nur mit der genannten Elektrode verbindet, ohne weiter zu einer anderen Elektrode zu führen? Gehe bei einem Erdungsring von einem Kupferring 2 AWG aus. Nimm mechanischen Schutz an, wo 250.64(B) ihn verlangt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What minimum copper grounding electrode conductor connects this service only to the stated electrode, without continuing to another electrode? For a ground ring, assume a 2 AWG copper ring. Assume physical protection where required by 250.64(B)."
